WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,110 --> 00:00:02,110
Why are your wings curled up?

2
00:00:02,110 --> 00:00:04,110
All the sub-tribes lost one

3
00:00:04,110 --> 00:00:05,110
You are too weak, right?

4
00:00:05,110 --> 00:00:07,110
Such a small scene can be so embarrassing

5
00:00:07,110 --> 00:00:08,110
Just your strength

6
00:00:08,110 --> 00:00:10,110
It’s better to keep a low profile from now on

7
00:00:10,110 --> 00:00:11,110
Before I get angry

8
00:00:11,110 --> 00:00:14,370
You'd better get out of here and escape and seek death.

9
00:00:14,370 --> 00:00:16,370
Then I'll give you a ride

10
00:00:17,400 --> 00:00:23,460
Don't talk about martial arts

11
00:00:23,460 --> 00:00:24,460
You're lucky

12
00:00:24,460 --> 00:00:25,460
I just went through a war

13
00:00:25,460 --> 00:00:27,460
Otherwise, you will drive Tang Lang away

14
00:00:27,460 --> 00:00:28,460
How can you be my opponent?

15
00:00:30,030 --> 00:00:31,030
Sorry

16
00:00:31,030 --> 00:00:32,030
The eighth-grade brawl you experienced

17
00:00:32,030 --> 00:00:34,030
It was also planned and led by me

18
00:00:36,060 --> 00:00:37,060
Transported back to the cave

19
00:00:37,060 --> 00:00:38,060
Be quick

20
00:00:38,060 --> 00:00:40,120
When I go to a place, another race will take advantage of the chaos to escape.

21
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:41,120
Fight, fight

22
00:00:41,120 --> 00:00:43,180
Fight to the death

23
00:00:43,180 --> 00:00:44,180
I'm so humble

24
00:00:44,180 --> 00:00:46,180
This is all eighth-grade food

25
00:00:46,180 --> 00:01:00,260
It’s you who makes up the difference

26
00:01:00,260 --> 00:01:03,260
How dare you show up, a coward like you?

27
00:01:03,260 --> 00:01:05,960
Am I not here?

28
00:01:05,960 --> 00:01:07,960
You coward, you came too late.

29
00:01:07,960 --> 00:01:09,960
I'm in a bad state now

30
00:01:09,960 --> 00:01:11,960
I'll wait a few days and then I'll fight you to the death.

31
00:01:11,960 --> 00:01:12,960
what does it mean

32
00:01:12,960 --> 00:01:14,960
Of course I'll keep you

33
00:01:18,080 --> 00:01:20,080
Grandpa Tang Lang Grandpa

34
00:01:20,080 --> 00:01:21,080
I'm convinced

35
00:01:21,080 --> 00:01:22,080
spare my life
